overrides/active-override.json
# FRESH-001 (2026-08-14): knowledge/ was entirely gitignored, which meant no generated
# fact bundle (model.yaml, api_surface.json, formats.md, claims.json) had any git
# history, diffability, or cross-session durability -- the structural root cause behind
# the cells/net stale-facts incident. merged/ (the actual fact bundle) is now tracked;
# _vectors/ (regenerable embeddings, 627M measured), scout/ (intermediate/regenerable),
# and local run-bookkeeping stay gitignored. Canonical classification lives in
# scripts/pipeline/config/knowledge_tracking_policy.yaml -- keep these patterns in sync
# with that file; scripts/pipeline/commands/ops/knowledge_git_migration.py enforces it.
/knowledge/_vectors/
/knowledge/*/*/scout/
/knowledge/*/*/.pipeline_state.json
# Family-level run bookkeeping (one level up from the family/platform pair above) --
# same "pure local run bookkeeping" rationale, just written at the family root by some
# pipeline steps instead of per-platform. Gap found live 2026-08-15: knowledge/3d/,
# knowledge/cells/, etc. .pipeline_state.json files were untracked-but-not-ignored,
# showing up as perpetually dirty in every session's git status.
/knowledge/*/.pipeline_state.json
/knowledge/*/*/merged/pipeline_run.json
/knowledge/*/*/merged/baseline_ledger*.json*
/knowledge/*/*/merged/knowledge_delta*.json
/knowledge/*/*/merged/format_delta.json
/knowledge/*/*/merged/manifest_delta.json
/knowledge/*/*/merged/conflict_receipts.jsonl
/knowledge/*/*/merged/merge_conflicts.json
/knowledge/*/*/merged/merge_conflicts.md
/knowledge/*/*/merged/workarounds.json
/knowledge/*/*/merged/test_context.md
/knowledge/*/*/merged/index.json
/knowledge/*/*/merged/class_graph.json
/knowledge/*/*/merged/coverage_matrix.json
# RPR-J-03 (SW-11 rescue): manually-curated formats.json note/manual entries and
# "Known Documentation Errors" blocks must survive a fresh clone -- committed here,
# unlike the rest of knowledge/ (a local, regenerable cache).
