# NOTE (TC-15, MT072-2026-09-23-EXAMPLE-VERIFICATION-PRODUCTIONIZATION,
# 2026-09-24): a stray, hand-appended `/reports` + `/reports/plan_state`
# pair used to live here, AFTER the generated GIT-TRACKING-POLICY block
# above -- later patterns win in .gitignore, so this silently re-ignored
# every negation that block declares (reports/audit/, .../example_
# verification_ledger/, .../example_verification_sweep/, .../plan_state/,
# .../repo-presenter-regen-full/) for any file not already tracked before
# this pair was added. This is the exact, disclosed root cause TC-07's own
# module docstring (example_verification_ledger.py) named as a blocker --
# confirmed still live here (`git ls-files reports/example_verification_
# ledger/` returned 0 of 33 real on-disk files) -- removed, not just
# worked around.

